es": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "A social species, chickens will cry out to one another in warning if they sense a hawk or other predator nearby. But if alone, a chicken will remain", "origin": [18.0, 148.5], "bbox": [18.0, 141.27978515625, 588.8942260742188, 150.5654296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [18.0, 141.27978515625, 588.8942260742188, 150.5654296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 5, "flags": 0, "bbox": [18.0, 155.52978515625, 568.2982177734375, 164.8154296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "silent so as not to attract the predator", "origin": [18.0, 162.75], "bbox": [18.0, 155.52978515625, 168.06768798828125, 164.8154296875]}, {"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (392 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 7.499996185302734, "descender": 0.0, "text": "’", "origin": [168.14700317382812, 162.75], "bbox": [168.14700317382812, 156.0, 169.94790649414062, 162.75]}, {"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "s attention. Sonja Hillemacher decided to use this behavior to determine whether individual chickens", "origin": [169.44895935058594, 162.75], "bbox": [169.44895935058594, 155.52978515625, 568.2982177734375, 164.8154296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [18.0, 155.52978515625, 568.2982177734375, 164.8154296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 6, "flags": 0, "bbox": [17.999969482421875, 169.77978515625, 593.62548828125, 179.0654296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "possess a capacity to recognize themselves visually when reflected in a mirror (a common standard for animal intelligence). In the first condition", "origin": [17.999969482421875, 177.0], "bbox": [17.999969482421875, 169.77978515625, 593.62548828125, 179.0654296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [17.999969482421875, 169.77978515625, 593.62548828125, 179.0654296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 7, "flags": 0, "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 184.77978515625, 577.8973388671875, 194.0654296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "of her study, the subject could see its reflection, but no other chickens were present. In a second condition, another chicken was visible to the", "origin": [17.99993896484375, 192.0], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 184.77978515625, 577.8973388671875, 194.0654296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 184.77978515625, 577.8973388671875, 194.0654296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 8, "flags": 0, "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 199.02978515625, 588.2703247070312, 208.3154296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "subject. Hillemacher presented an image of a hawk to the subject in both conditions, reasoning that if chickens lacked a capacity for visual self-", "origin": [17.99993896484375, 206.25], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 199.02978515625, 588.2703247070312, 208.3154296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 199.02978515625, 588.2703247070312, 208.3154296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 9, "flags": 0, "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 213.27978515625, 111.09918212890625, 222.5654296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "recognition, then ______", "origin": [17.99993896484375, 220.5], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 213.27978515625, 111.09918212890625, 222.5654296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [17.99993896484375, 213.27978515625, 111.09918212890625, 222.5654296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 10, "flags": 0, "bbox": [18.0, 239.52978515625, 209.88607788085938, 248.8154296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.2949206829071045, "text": "Which choice most logically completes the text?", "origin": [18.0, 246.75], "bbox": [18.0, 239.52978515625, 209.88607788085938, 248.8154296875]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [18.0, 239.52978515625, 209.88607788085938, 248.8154296875]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 11, "flags": 0, "bbox": [18.0, 266.25, 48.297325134277344, 274.142578125], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (384 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 7.499996185302734, "descender": -1.2695306539535522, "text": "Answer", "origin": [18.0, 273.0], "bbox": [18.0, 266.25, 48.297325134277344, 274.142578125]}], "wmode": 0, "dir": [1.0, 0.0], "bbox": [18.0, 266.25, 48.297325134277344, 274.142578125]}]}, {"type": 0, "number": 12, "flags": 0, "bbox": [18.035200119018555, 280.77978515625, 319.59906005859375, 290.0654296875], "lines": [{"spans": [{"size": 0.8999999761581421, "flags": 0, "bidi": 0, "char_flags": 16, "font": "Type3 (336 0 R)", "color": 0, "alpha": 255, "ascender": 8.022457122802734, "descender": -2.294920